1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,630
Ready? 모음 둘!
Ready? Two vowels (make one)!

2
00:00:01,630 --> 00:00:03,430
오, 아, 와!
o + a = wa! (say o-a fast: wa)

3
00:00:03,430 --> 00:00:06,131
오, 아, 와!
o + a = wa!

4
00:00:06,131 --> 00:00:07,331
오 아 와!
o + a = wa!

5
00:00:07,331 --> 00:00:08,532
우 어 워!
u + eo = wo!

6
00:00:08,532 --> 00:00:09,732
우 이 위!
u + i = wi!

7
00:00:09,732 --> 00:00:10,730
으 이 의!
eu + i = ui! (say "eu-i" quickly)

8
00:00:10,730 --> 00:00:15,230
오 더하기 아는?
o plus a is…? (think, then say it!)

9
00:00:15,230 --> 00:00:16,033
와!
wa!

10
00:00:16,033 --> 00:00:18,201
으 더하기 이는?
eu plus i is…? (think, then say it!)

11
00:00:18,201 --> 00:00:21,284
의!
ui!

12
00:00:21,284 --> 00:00:23,535
와! 워! 위! 의!
wa! wo! wi! ui!

13
00:00:23,535 --> 00:00:25,941
와! 워! 위! 의!
wa! wo! wi! ui!

14
00:00:25,941 --> 00:00:28,336
따라 해 봐, 모음 댄스!
Follow me — vowel dance!

15
00:00:28,336 --> 00:00:30,736
와! 워! 위! 의!
wa! wo! wi! ui!

16
00:00:30,736 --> 00:00:31,936
고 아 과!
go + a = gwa! (as in 사과, apple)

17
00:00:31,936 --> 00:00:33,137
구 이 귀!
gu + i = gwi! (ear)

18
00:00:33,137 --> 00:00:34,337
주 이 쥐!
ju + i = jwi! (mouse)

19
00:00:34,337 --> 00:00:35,537
무 어 뭐!
mu + eo = mwo! (what?)

20
00:00:35,537 --> 00:00:37,938
와! 워! 위! 의!
wa! wo! wi! ui!

21
00:00:37,938 --> 00:00:40,341
와! 워! 위! 의!
wa! wo! wi! ui!

22
00:00:40,341 --> 00:00:42,738
따라 해 봐, 모음 댄스!
Follow me — vowel dance!

23
00:00:42,738 --> 00:00:45,139
와! 워! 위! 의!
wa! wo! wi! ui!

24
00:00:45,139 --> 00:00:46,651
오, 아, 와!
o + a = wa!

25
00:00:46,651 --> 00:00:47,801
안녕!
Annyeong! (Bye!)

26
00:00:47,801 --> 00:00:48,951
읽어 볼까요?
Can you read these?

27
00:00:49,001 --> 00:00:50,001
봐
Try it first!

28
00:00:50,001 --> 00:00:50,951
봐!
bwa! (look)

29
00:00:51,001 --> 00:00:52,001
줘
Try it first!

30
00:00:52,001 --> 00:00:52,951
줘!
jwo! (give)

31
00:00:53,001 --> 00:00:54,001
쉬
Try it first!

32
00:00:54,001 --> 00:00:56,051
쉬!
swi! (rest)
